<title>JAPAN: NTT's shares rise to calender year high.</title>
<headline>NTT's shares rise to calender year high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp rose to a high for 1997 on Wednesday morning, as the company's inclusion in the Morgan Stanley Capital International's Japan index continued to attract investors, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0148 GMT, the shares were up 40,000 yen at 1.09 million yen, after hitting a high of 1.1 million yen earlier in the morning.</p>
